# a bass line on track 3 with components: a note from the keys, steps, a ramp, a chance, a lock, undo
wait 200
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
wait 40
shot bass_engine.png
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
shot bass_preset.png
tapkey 0
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tapkey w3
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
expect note 3 1 1 53
wait 40
shot bass_steps.png
# a longer note: hold step 1 and press step 3
key w0 down
wait 100
tapkey w2
key w0 up
# a ramp up on step 4 (HOME + step, white key 5), its value black key 4
press HOME
key w3 down
wait 60
tapkey w4
tapkey b3
key w3 up
release HOME
expect comp 3 4 5
# a chance on step 7, a nudge with OCT+
key w6 down
wait 100
spin K3 50
tap OCT+
wait 40
shot bass_chance.png
key w6 up
# a lock: hold step 11, press FX, turn K1 (cutoff)
key w10 down
wait 100
tap FX
wait 40
shot bass_lock.png
spin K1 -20
key w10 up
wait 40
shot bass_done.png
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap PLAY
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
expect playing 0
